        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >123 MAZES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax. Escape. Chill.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>123 MAZES</i> is a soothing 2D single-player puzzle game built to help you unwind, destress, and feel a sense of calm accomplishment. Navigate through 123 mazes using simple, intuitive controls — either your keyboard, a gamepad controller, or effortless mouse-hover movement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✦ FEATURES ✦</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>123 progressively challenging mazes</strong> – a perfect blend of chill and brain-teasing<br>🎨 <strong>13 ball colors</strong> to match your favorite color <br>🌄 <strong>4 unique background packs</strong>: Scenery, Animals, Fantasy, Sci-Fi, and more!<br>🎵 <strong>5 genres of relaxing music</strong> to choose from<br>⚙️ <strong>Fully customizable</strong>: ball speed, controls, themes, and more<br>🌙 <strong>Frustration-free design</strong> with soft dark background options — easy on the eyes<br>🏆 <strong>100+ Achievements</strong> for the completionists and goal-setters</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 WHO’S IT FOR?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maze enthusiast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kids looking for fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Senior wanting something gentle and engaging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mental health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievement hunter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual gamer seeking to destress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>123 MAZES</strong> is your go-to relaxing escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern graphics. Minimal stress. Maximum Zen.</strong><br>Just pick a color, a tune, and start your journey through clean, calming mazes.</p>",
